OL,4,CSuffolk village votes to 'leave the    
OL,5,CUK' over plan to house migrants at     
OL,6,Cformer military base                   
OL,7,GResidents of Barnham, Suffolk have     
OL,8,Goverwhelmingly voted to "leave the UK" 
OL,9,Gin a symbolic referendum.              
OL,11,FThe result was announced after about   
OL,12,F30 minutes of counting, with 257 votes 
OL,13,Fcast in favour of leaving while 16     
OL,14,Fpeople voted against.                  
OL,16,FMany locals were angry at government   
OL,17,Fproposals to house asylum seekers at a 
OL,18,Fformer military base, which was the    
OL,19,Fscene of protests outside when news of 
OL,20,Fthe plan emerged.                      
OL,22,                                   G1/2 
