OL,3,T///,/,-.,./,,-,-,-.-.,-.,/-.-.,.,.,,///
OL,4,CSuffolk village votes to 'leave the    
OL,5,CUK' over plan to house migrants at     
OL,6,Cformer military base                   
OL,7,FThe Home Office, which insists it has  
OL,8,Fbeen listening to villagers' concerns, 
OL,9,Fsays about 930 men could be placed at  
OL,10,FRAF Barnham.                           
OL,12,FBarnham is the second village to hold  
OL,13,Fa symbolic poll over migrant housing   
OL,14,Fplans, after residents of Piddington   
OL,15,Fin Oxfordshire voted to leave the UK   
OL,16,Fin September.                          
OL,22,                                   G2/2 
