OL,4,CAttempted murder charge over           
OL,5,Ccouncillor stabbing                    
OL,6,GA man has appeared in court charged    
OL,7,Gwith attempted murder after a Bradford 
OL,8,Gcouncillor was seriously injured in a  
OL,9,Gstabbing.                              
OL,11,FCouncillor Ibrar Ali was attacked at   
OL,12,Fabout 11:00 GMT on Thursday on         
OL,13,FThornbury Avenue, before being driven  
OL,14,Fto nearby Manse Street, according to   
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police.                 
