OL,4,CFight over fossil fuels leaves COP31   
OL,5,Cclimate talks in deadlock              
OL,6,GNegotiations at the COP31 UN climate   
OL,7,Gsummit in Turkey are in deadlock,      
OL,8,Ghaving run more than 24 hours into     
OL,9,Govertime as countries remain unable to 
OL,10,Gagree on a new global climate deal.    
OL,12,FIn a late intervention on Friday, a    
OL,13,Fgroup of countries led by France and   
OL,14,FPanama pushed back against the draft   
OL,15,Fagreement which included no reference  
OL,16,Fto reducing the world's demand for     
OL,17,Ffossil fuels.                          
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
