OL,4,CSerious crash closes M42 near          
OL,5,CBirmingham Airport                     
OL,6,GMotorists have been warned the M42     
OL,7,Gnear Birmingham Airport could remain   
OL,8,Gclosed for several hours after a       
OL,9,Gserious crash involving a vehicle fire.
OL,11,FNational Highways said the northbound  
OL,12,Fcarriageway was shut between junction  
OL,13,F5A and junction six following the      
OL,14,Fcrash, with police, fire and ambulance 
OL,15,Fservices attending.                    
OL,17,FDrivers caught in standstill traffic   
OL,18,Fdescribed seeing a "huge fire" after   
OL,19,Fthe crash, while West Midlands Police  
OL,20,Furged motorists to avoid the area.     
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
