OL,4,CMexican drug lord on FBI's 10 most     
OL,5,Cwanted list arrested in shoot-out      
OL,6,GA Mexican drug lord who was on the     
OL,7,GFBI's 10 most wanted list has been     
OL,8,Garrested following a shoot-out with    
OL,9,GMexican authorities.                   
OL,11,FFausto Isidro "Chapo Isidro" Meza      
OL,12,FFlores was detained along with his     
OL,13,Flieutenant by Mexican special forces   
OL,14,Fin Guasave, Sinaloa on Friday,         
OL,15,FMexico's defence secretariat said.     
OL,17,FMeza Flores was wanted in Mexico on    
OL,18,Forganised crime charges, while he has  
OL,19,Fbeen accused of "flooding the US with  
OL,20,Ffentanyl, cocaine, heroin and other    
OL,21,Fdeadly drugs" by the FBI. The US is    
OL,22,Fseeking his extradition.               
